        <h3>Where November 7 Fell in Each Run</h3>
        <p>The weeks split three ways:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>{{N_FIRST}} songs were in their first week at number one: "Gypsys, Tramps & Thieves," "I Can See Clearly Now," "You Haven't Done Nothin'," "Island Girl," "Rock'n Me," "You Needed Me" and "Pop Muzik."</li>
          <li>{{N_MID}} were in the middle of a longer run: "I'll Be There" and "You Light Up My Life."</li>
          <li>One, "Midnight Train to Georgia," was in the last week of its run.</li>
        </ul>

